."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-11-1-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-11-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-prideTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.000043,"statusNotes":"Dante hears the burdened souls pray for those who remain alive."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-11-1-virgil","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virgil","eventId":"purgatorio-event-11-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-prideTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.000043,"statusNotes":"Virgil asks for the least difficult passage suitable for Dante’s body."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-11-1-proud","characterId":"purgatorio-char-proud","eventId":"purgatorio-event-11-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-prideTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.000043,"statusNotes":"The souls pray the Lord’s Prayer together while moving under unequal weights."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-11-2-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-11-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-prideTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.000044,"statusNotes":"Dante hears a bent speaker confess the ancestral pride that destroyed his house."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt