rsation."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-16-4-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-16-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":16.000064,"statusNotes":"Dante accepts the account of failed governance and asks about good Gherardo."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-16-4-virgil","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virgil","eventId":"purgatorio-event-16-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":16.000064,"statusNotes":"Virgil continues toward the smoke’s brightening edge with Dante."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-16-4-marco","characterId":"purgatorio-char-marco","eventId":"purgatorio-event-16-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":16.000064,"statusNotes":"Marco distinguishes spiritual and temporal rule, names surviving examples of courtesy, and departs before the angel appears."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-17-1-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":17.000065,"statusNotes":"Dante emerges from the smoke and experiences inward images of wrath and self-destruction."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-17-1-virgil","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virgil","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathTerrace","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":17.000065,"statusNotes":"Virgil leads Dante into the light of the setting sun."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-17-2-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathStair","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":17.000066,"statusNotes":"Dante’s vision breaks under a dazzling light and he follows a voice toward the stair."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-17-2-virgil","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virgil","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathStair","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":17.000066,"statusNotes":"Virgil urges haste before night takes away the power to climb."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-17-2-terraceAngel","characterId":"purgatorio-char-terraceAngel","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-wrathStair","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-terraces","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":17.000066,"statusNotes":"The angel of peace indicates the ascent and fans Dante with wings while proclaiming a blessing."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":179228160