2,"statusNotes":"Beatrice remains by the tree and chariot during its binding."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-2-procession","characterId":"purgatorio-char-procession","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000122,"statusNotes":"The sacred company praises the griffin and sings a hymn beyond Dante’s ability to record."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-2-griffin","characterId":"purgatorio-char-griffin","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000122,"statusNotes":"The griffin refuses the tree’s fruit and binds the chariot’s pole to its trunk."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-2-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000122,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens attend the chariot beside the renewing tree."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-3-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000123,"statusNotes":"Dante wakes at the river guide’s call and is told to watch the chariot for the world’s good."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-3-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000123,"statusNotes":"Statius stays with the smaller company remaining under the tree."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-3-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000123,"statusNotes":"The river guide wakes Dante and points out Beatrice beneath the new leaves."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-3-beatrice","characterId":"purgatorio-char-beatrice","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000123,"statusNotes":"Beatrice sits on the ground as guardian of the chariot and instructs Dante to record what happens."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-3-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000123,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens encircle Beatrice with their lights; the rest of the pageant ascends after the griffin."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"Dante obeys the command to watch as attacks transform the chariot and a giant drags it into the forest."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"Statius remains with the witnesses under the tree as the chariot is attacked."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"The river guide stays with the company while the allegorical assault unfolds."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-beatrice","characterId":"purgatorio-char-beatrice","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"Beatrice rebukes the fox and watches the chariot’s degradation."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens remain around Beatrice during the assault on the vehicle."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-32-4-assailants","characterId":"purgatorio-char-assailants","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":32.000124,"statusNotes":"Within the witnessed allegory an eagle strikes and feathers the car, a fox is driven off, a dragon tears out its floor, and a woman and giant seize the transformed vehicle."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-1-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000125,"statusNotes":"Dante is summoned closer, hears a dark prophecy, and is charged to carry its images back to the living."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-1-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000125,"statusNotes":"Statius follows Beatrice with Dante and the lady of the forest."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-1-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000125,"statusNotes":"The still unnamed forest guide follows the prophetic speaker with the two poets."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-1-beatrice","characterId":"purgatorio-char-beatrice","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000125,"statusNotes":"Beatrice comforts the mourning maidens and promises the downfall of the chariot’s captors."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-1-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-knowledgeTree","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000125,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens lament in alternating song before moving ahead at Beatrice’s command."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-2-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000126,"statusNotes":"Dante struggles to understand Beatrice, then sees two streams issue from a single source."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-2-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000126,"statusNotes":"Statius follows toward the paired waters while Dante questions Beatrice."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-2-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000126,"statusNotes":"The lady accompanies the company toward the source of the two streams."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-2-beatrice","characterId":"purgatorio-char-beatrice","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000126,"statusNotes":"Beatrice explains Dante’s forgetfulness after Lethe and walks toward the waters near noon."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-2-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000126,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens halt at the edge of a dark shadow beside the two streams."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-3-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000127,"statusNotes":"Dante is told to question Matelda about the waters already explained to him."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-3-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000127,"statusNotes":"Statius waits with Dante at the source while the lady is asked to explain it again."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-3-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000127,"statusNotes":"Beatrice calls the forest guide Matilda; the lady recalls that she has already explained the waters."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-3-beatrice","characterId":"purgatorio-char-beatrice","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000127,"statusNotes":"Beatrice names the guide and tells her to restore Dante’s half-dormant capacity through Eunoe."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-3-virtues","characterId":"purgatorio-char-virtues","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000127,"statusNotes":"The seven maidens have halted near the source while Beatrice directs the final renewal."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-4-dante","characterId":"purgatorio-char-dante","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000128,"statusNotes":"Dante is led to Eunoe and returns from its water renewed and ready for the stars."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-4-statius","characterId":"purgatorio-char-statius","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000128,"statusNotes":"Statius is invited to accompany Dante to the renewing water."},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-snapshot-33-4-matelda","characterId":"purgatorio-char-matelda","eventId":"purgatorio-event-33-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"purgatorio-loc-eunoeBank","currentMapLayerId":"purgatorio-map-paradise","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":33.000128,"statusNotes":"Matelda takes Dante by the hand and invites Statius to join the final passage."}],"item