ping","notes":"The porter uses silver and golden keys; neither is given to the travellers.","sortKey":9.000039},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-3","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-9-4","condition":"Seven marks","notes":"The sword traces seven P-shaped wounds on Dante’s brow.","sortKey":9.000039},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-4","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-12-4","condition":"Six marks","notes":"Dante checks with his fingers and finds that the first mark has gone.","sortKey":12.00005},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-5","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-15-2","condition":"Five marks","notes":"Virgil states that two wounds have already been extinguished and five remain.","sortKey":15.000058},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-6","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-17-2","condition":"Four marks","notes":"The third angelic passage continues the removal of the porter’s marks.","sortKey":17.000066},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-7","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-19-2","condition":"Three marks","notes":"The passage above sloth completes the fourth stage of the marked ascent.","sortKey":19.000073},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-8","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-22-1","condition":"Two marks","notes":"The canto opens by confirming another mark has been erased before the sixth round.","sortKey":22.000084},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-9","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-24-4","condition":"One remaining terrace","notes":"The blessing of measured appetite precedes the final cornice and its purifying fire.","sortKey":24.000094},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-10","itemId":"purgatorio-item-letters","eventId":"purgatorio-event-27-2","condition":"Final fire crossed","notes":"Dante passes through the last purifying flame; no additional count is silently supplied.","sortKey":27.000103},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-11","itemId":"purgatorio-item-chariot","eventId":"purgatorio-event-29-3","condition":"Drawn in procession","notes":"The two-natured griffin draws the chariot among the four living creatures.","sortKey":29.000112},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-12","itemId":"purgatorio-item-chariot","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-2","condition":"Bound to the tree","notes":"The griffin binds the pole beneath the tree’s branches.","sortKey":32.000122},{"worldId":"purgatorio-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"purgatorio-item-state-13","itemId":"purgatorio-item-chariot","eventId":"purgatorio-event-32-4","condition":"Attacked and seized","notes":"The allegorical attacks damage and transform the car before the giant drags it into the forest.","sortKey":32.000124}],"locationSnapshots":[],"mapAnnotations":[],"mapRegionSnapshots":[],"mapRegions":[],"sceneRevisions":[],"timelineRelationships":[],"travelModes":[],"writingLogs":[]}
